	<!-- uikit:minimap marks=64 -->
	<!--
		GENERATED by `python -m uikit generate`.
		Minimap: map picture, current and next zone circles, 64 marker(s).
		Positions are x-N / y-N on two nested panels (one transform per axis), radii r-N on the ring,
		a shrink is dur-N then the target classes, run by the client.
		Zoom: everything on the map sits in mm_zoom (zoom-*, a scale) > mm_pan / mm_pan_y (px-* / py-*, centre on the player).

		Slot reference: docs/CONTRACTS.md, or `python -m uikit slots <component>`.
		Root authored hidden: a custom_hud_layout is shown to every player; per-player state only overlays.
	-->
